From bf7ddf422b027142488fcd40cb46abaf2b7c1056 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Koen Kooi <koen@dominion.thruhere.net>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 10:17:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] layer.conf: relocate wic/ to files/wic, drop the
 WKS_SEARCH_PATH workaround

The prior fix (WKS_SEARCH_PATH:append in layer.conf) worked around this
layer's .wks files living outside the files/wic convention instead of
moving them, specifically to avoid touching vendored files. Two problems
with that approach, found together:

- The append itself silently never took effect -- git apply/format-patch
  dropped the actual append line on regeneration, leaving only the seeded
  default in WKS_SEARCH_PATH (confirmed via bitbake-getvar: meta-meson/wic
  is absent from the resolved value). Any machine needing these .wks files
  (e.g. libretech-ac) currently fails do_image_wic with "No kickstart
  files from WKS_FILES were found" -- the exact failure that fix was
  written to prevent.

- Independently, oe-core's own sanity checker (sanity.bbclass,
  check_sanity_everybuild) unconditionally flags any wic/ directory found
  under BBPATH/BBLAYERS as an obsolete location needing to move to
  files/wic -- this has nothing to do with WKS_SEARCH_PATH and fires
  regardless of whether the append worked, as a hard error that aborts
  the build.

Relocating to the convention location fixes both: the class's own weak
WKS_SEARCH_PATH default finds the files with no layer-specific append
needed at all, and the sanity check has nothing left to flag.

Signed-off-by: Koen Kooi <koen@dominion.thruhere.net>
---
 {wic => files/wic}/sdimage-bootpart-meson.wks | 0
 {wic => files/wic}/sdimage-meson.wks          | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename {wic => files/wic}/sdimage-bootpart-meson.wks (100%)
 rename {wic => files/wic}/sdimage-meson.wks (100%)

diff --git a/wic/sdimage-bootpart-meson.wks b/files/wic/sdimage-bootpart-meson.wks
similarity index 100%
rename from wic/sdimage-bootpart-meson.wks
rename to files/wic/sdimage-bootpart-meson.wks
diff --git a/wic/sdimage-meson.wks b/files/wic/sdimage-meson.wks
similarity index 100%
rename from wic/sdimage-meson.wks
rename to files/wic/sdimage-meson.wks
-- 
2.50.1 (Apple Git-155)

